msgid "Don't have bigdatacloud.com account? <a href=\"https://www.bigdatacloud.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Signup here</a><br/>Get 50K requests per month for free. Upgrade for more."
msgstr "Har du ikke bigdatacloud.com -konto? <a href=\"https://www.bigdatacloud.com/\" target=\"_blank\"> Tilmelding her </a> <br/> Få 50k -anmodninger pr. Måned gratis. Opgrader for mere."

