msgid "If you enable this rule, then it is highly recommended that you use a separate Phone Number Validation plugin to make sure your customers specify a correct international phone number format on the checkout page. Else, this rule will treat an invalid phone number as a risk."
msgstr "Hvis du aktiverer denne regel, anbefales det stærkt, at du bruger et separat telefonnummervaliderings -plugin for at sikre, at dine kunder specificerer et korrekt internationalt telefonnummerformat på kassen. Ellers behandler denne regel et ugyldigt telefonnummer som en risiko."

