msgstr "Regel for at kontrollere, at køber bestiller produkter, der bruger forskellige adresser fra den samme IP over en bestemt periode fra din butik."

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1543
msgid ""
"Purchased from same IP but Different Customer Addresses?\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t"
msgstr ""
"Købt fra samme IP men forskellige kundeadresser?\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1552
msgid "Enable this rule to monitor if multiple orders with different billing or shipping addresses have originated from the same IP address. Make sure to set time span of checking."
msgstr "Aktivér denne regel for at overvåge, om flere ordrer med forskellige fakturerings- eller forsendelsesadresser er stammer fra den samme IP -adresse. Sørg for at indstille tidsrum for at kontrollere."

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1569
msgid "Past Number of Days to Check "
msgstr "Tidligere antal dage til at kontrollere "

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1572
msgid "The number of days in the past to check IP addresses and different physical addresses."
msgstr "Antallet af dage tidligere for at kontrollere IP -adresser og forskellige fysiske adresser."

